Package: irremote
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-pyqt6, python3-dbus, elksmart-comm, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Suggests: libkf6config-bin
Description: friendly desktop remote control for USB infrared blasters
 IR Remote turns an ELK Smart / OCRUSTAR USB infrared blaster (045c:0132)
 into a remote control on your desktop. Teach it the buttons of your real
 remotes (TV, soundbar, fan, ...) once, then press them from the window, a
 picture of your remote, the tray, a keyboard shortcut or a script.
 .
 The dongle itself is driven by elksmart-comm (package elksmart-comm).
 notify-send (libnotify-bin) shows errors from keyboard-shortcut sends;
 kwriteconfig6 (libkf6config-bin) saves KDE Plasma global shortcuts the way
 System Settings does.
